  "notes": "Written from the binary and from the tunnel. What it needs: agw.paz.co.il, dapi.paz.co.il and lbpub.paz.co.il (the network security configuration names paz.co.il, dapi.paz.co.il and creditguard.co.il), CreditGuard for payment, ws-eu.pusher.com, Google Maps and Firebase. Blocked: the Vimeo player and CDN, which carry the full screen advertising videos behind What's New (seen: player.vimeo.com, download-video-ak.vimeocdn.com), AppsFlyer under the tocqqo prefix, Emarsys marketing (its inbox, events and recommender), the Facebook SDK and New Relic. What it costs: What's New stories that are videos will not play. Banner images still come from Paz's own servers, which is why the entry is flagged."
